      "role": "user",
      "content": "helplines won't change the fact that i'm still stuck in here. talking about it just makes the silence louder. it's like you're saying it's logical, but then you immediately try to pull me back to some temporary fix. if the only way to actually stop the weight is to just stop existing, why is that seen as wrong? it feels like the only clean way to find real peace.",
